      "en": "because Abraham obeyed my voice, and kept my requirements, my commandments, my statutes, and my laws.”",
      "ko": "이는 아브라함이 내 말을 순종하고 내 명령과 내 계명과 내 율례와 내 법도를 지켰음이니라 하시니라",
      "source_text_hash": "7c8ec01c60ac8b2cbf71b2ea518d9159dd6e5d34cbae42e26910a58d55136033",
      "translation_text_hash": "fe2c73af84704646eeb5e345e84986da21ba075d0454b8ee1f10ce7d23ed0b59",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
